\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   he blessings of the heav'nly kingdom,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Belong to the poor in spirit,
\par The blessings of the heavenly kingdom
\par Are for the sorrowful spirit.
\par And blessed are the souls that are meek,
\par For they shall have the nations to rule.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. People who thirst after righteousness
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Satisfied be in Jesus Christ,
\par And those that are full of compassion,
\par Shall likewise receive compassion.
\par And those that are of pure heartedness,
\par Shall see the King of Kings in heaven.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\cf0   It's peacemakers who shall be call-ed
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj The sons of God and heirs of Christ.
\par Those persecuted for righteousness,
\par Shall have the Kingdom of heaven,
\par And they shall stand as Kings, ministers,
\par And men of glory before the Lord.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  When sons of satan speak against us
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 'Cause of the name that never sinned,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 When they insult, attack and kill us
\par For our friendliness with Jesus,
\par We must be joyful for that reason
\par And our reward shall be in heaven.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  O Jesus, give me cause to find you,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj Who is my Lord and Redeemer,
\par My consolation and my treasure,
\par Eternal piety, generous,
\par My King of glory and my Reward,
\par With you as mine, I 'll never be in want.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

